# dexUnifiedApi — Live Order WebSocket
# REST Client does not support WebSocket requests directly.

# --- websocat ---
#   websocat ws://127.0.0.1:5010/ws/live_offers
#
# Example with query params:
#   websocat "ws://127.0.0.1:5010/ws/live_offers?cex=kraken&fee_tier=standard&confirmations=1&exclude_cexes=binance&max_fiat_limit=1000"

# --- Hoppscotch ---
# Realtime -> WebSocket
#   ws://127.0.0.1:5010/ws/live_offers

# --- wscat ---
#   wscat -c ws://127.0.0.1:5010/ws/live_offers
